  user_1,"[00:00] Hi Anita it's Meera. I just got the updated policy doc thanks."
  user_2,"[00:10] Hi Meera! Glad you got it. Anything else I can help with today?"
  user_1,"[00:20] Yeah I was looking at the coverage dates... It says start 01/10/2026 ends 01/10/2027 right?"
  user_2,"[00:30] That's correct. It's a 12‑month term."
  user_1,"[00:45] I noticed the premium is $1,150. I was wondering if there’s any way to lower it further maybe add a safe driver discount? I haven't had any accidents."
  user_2,"[00:55] Let me check... [typing] ... Yes we can apply a safe driver discount of $50 bringing it down to $1,100."
  user_1,"[01:10] Oh that's great! Could you also confirm the deductible? I think it's $500."
  user_2,"[01:20] Yes the deductible is $500 per claim."
  user_1,"[01:30] Perfect. One more thing—can I get a digital copy of the insurance card sent to my email? I need it for the rental car."
  user_2,"[01:40] Absolutely I'll email it right after we hang up. Anything else?"
  user_1,"[01:50] No that's all. Thanks for your help!"
  user_2,"[01:55] You're welcome! Have a great day."